1000 GOSUB 6100:BM$="Back at the hotel, David was having trouble falling asleep, still excited\after his showdown with the professional gambler.":GOSUB 5100
1010 BM$="He turned off the lights and lied on the bed, to no avail.":GOSUB 5100
1020 GOSUB 6140:BM$="He raised his hand towards the ceiling and looked up, for no particular\reason.":GOSUB 5100
1030 BM$="The faint moonlight coming from the window illuminated his hand, in the\darkness of the night.":GOSUB 5100
1035 GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 6150:BM$="He noticed some kind of aura around his hand.":GOSUB 5100
1040 GOSUB 6160:BM$="He kept staring at his hand. Slowly and steadily, the energy was changing\shape, following his imagination.":GOSUB 5100
1045 GOSUB 6900
1050 GOSUB 6120:BM$="He could see a castle surrounded by nature.":GOSUB 5100
1055 GOSUB 6910
1060 GOSUB 6130:BM$="The scene changed to two men talking from the top of the castle, looking\down at the nature, stretching as far as the eye could see.":GOSUB 5100
1070 BM$="One of the men looked like David - no, it wasn't a simple resemblance. It WAS\him, as he would look like 10 years in the future.":GOSUB 5100
1080 GOSUB 1200
1090 CM=2:CM$(1)="Hroth spoke.":CM$(2)="The man spoke."
