1350 GOSUB 6105:BM$="The sunlight coming through the window woke him up. His body still felt\somewhat heavy, but he was able to sleep through the entire night.":GOSUB 5100
1360 BM$="He took a shower, and left the room to have breakfast.":GOSUB 5100
1370 GOSUB 6170:BM$="When he entered the restaurant, he saw Susanna drinking a cup of coffee.\He took a seat next to her.":GOSUB 5100
