1600 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Good morning, David. You're up early, I see. It's still 10 am.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I didn't have any nightmares this time, so I slept well.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: See, I told you the ring would work! But you DO look a little tired.\Are you feeling okay?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1630 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Yeah, uhmm... I didn't have any nightmares, but I did have some kind of\vision... As if I was seeing a recording of ancient times.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1640 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: That sounds interesting! Were you in there?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1650 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Kinda. There was a man called Hroth. He looked like me, just older. He\was some kind of benevolent king, trying to make the world a better place.":GOSUB 5100
1660 BM$="David told Susanna all he could remember.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1670 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: A benevolent king that looks a lot like you? That's a lovely story!\So, what happened with that northern kingdom?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1680 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Unfortunately, that's when the scene disappeared, and I couldn't\summon it again. For some reason, conjuring that footage made me very\tired.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1690 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Maybe you'll see the rest tonight. You should have a hearty meal\to build up your stamina!":GOSUB 5100
